v></div><div data-rid="f1a0f495-517d-408a-8fdc-f84cea62149d" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-hf7unc" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="1b86d4e5-2b04-4341-a75a-c6a808628ff0" aria-expanded="false" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-151rgwd"><div data-rid="816f5447-531c-4a59-8841-08b9fcb33420" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-174js6f alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>Do I have to be home for delivery?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="d1936484-a6bd-4d78-98aa-dd6031cba84a" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1y3c2i"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-zxf308" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden=""><div data-rid="51b40f42-f299-45c9-a293-3799591d39ca" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-89h22h"><div data-rid="338f8abf-fac8-4076-9deb-e763ef1c8a24" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1m35d42 alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>Your fish arrives frozen in an eco-friendly, insulated box with the perfect amount of dry ice to keep your seafood frozen until the end of your scheduled delivery day.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="1abe2c57-8abe-4c96-a9e8-bc1cc84b4ca6" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-gr8b93" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="f5467843-3ab2-48e1-8374-60ebecd17564" aria-expanded="false" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-2cej3w"><div data-rid="b6aff394-b55f-414c-af7b-0ffb70ee53bd" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-128mpfr alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>Why a membership?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="8c1c22fb-d434-428a-95d2-9d8d76a0a32a" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1btpw4a"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-yhkw33" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden=""><div data-rid="41f1d983-8ab6-4fd6-989d-1e659121cc74" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="accordion-overflow" id="accordion-overflow" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-tyhpy1"><div data-rid="d21513d3-2f0a-497f-ae3f-1b4fbd502b9d" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-9mov3x alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>A Seatopia membership is like a Community Supported Seafood box, bridging the gap between you and sustainable aquafarms. This model allows our farmers to plan their harvests more effectively, promoting a focus on quality and ecosystem health. In line with the Slow Food Movement, we're stepping away from impersonal, commodity-based supply chains. Subscriptions are flexible—you get preferred pricing, and can adjust or cancel anytime. This isn't just about buying seafood; it's a pact for a sustainable, transparent food system.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f8166848-da31-4797-ae29-f06e38dd0953" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1she0uv" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="5f261ecb-1d9c-49e4-b4ca-2ffd9609a975" aria-expanded="false" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-guqn6n"><div data-rid="f01d3b11-0fe7-4cfa-b76d-c3925edcbe8c" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-hy16yk alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>Why choose farmed instead of wild-caught?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="b861c8ec-6ea6-42e3-8329-bab53bad51b5" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-9rmp78"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-tqjs8z" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden=""><div data-rid="be3b0455-b579-4604-88db-26b52442ad16" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="accordion-overflow" id="accordion-overflow" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-1jzs5l6"><div data-rid="1175593f-85f0-4fce-a002-a1bb1c3ba335" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1s5ag5 alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><strong>Cleaner Profile</strong><br>Thanks to our stringent farming practices, specific species selection, and certified clean feed, our farm-raised seafood contains lower levels of mercury, PCBs, and microplastics compared to many wild-caught alternatives.</p></span></div><div data-rid="a6d3a84a-e353-4d36-ad1b-0a899e48475a" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-xq6iou alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><strong>Nutrient-Rich</strong><br>Our seafood is higher in essential nutrients and omega-3 fatty acids. This is because we control the diets of our fish to optimize their health benefits, ensuring they are fed a balanced diet rich in the nutrients that matter most.</p></span></div><div data-rid="a2620d3a-b0ed-4f80-9a9d-169cbb3541c2" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-16yboys alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><strong>Natural Coloring</strong><br>Just like wild-caught fish, the vibrant colors of our farm-raised seafood come from a diet high in antioxidant-rich micro-algae, specifically astaxanthin. This means you're getting a product that's not only beautiful but also natural.</p></span></div><div data-rid="14f192cf-7769-4eee-8fd1-40f7a62ac0f9" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-vucrqr alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><strong>No Antibiotics or Hormones<br></strong>We're committed to raising our seafood without the use of antibiotics or hormones. This aligns with our ethos of providing you with the cleanest, most natural products possible.</p></span></div><div data-rid="23e3fb66-245e-4a31-988d-2954f7596dd1" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1yz7s8w alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><strong>Sustainability & Scalability</strong><br>Our approach to aquaculture is not only sustainable but also scalable. This ensures that we can continue to provide high-quality seafood while having a minimal impact on marine ecosystems.</p></span></div><div data-rid="8f0191cd-377a-41f2-b044-8604024a0c77" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1828ewb alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>So when you choose Seatopia's farm-raised seafood, you're opting for a product that's superior in quality, nutritional value, and environmental impact. Learn more.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b42c7007-5a92-4b8f-a0ff-2cc687bd2675" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-l99rbz" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="fed0d439-436f-4d67-971d-66b1bf76ce96" aria-expanded="false" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-14h4wx3"><div data-rid="b88dd35a-c79e-48b3-878f-bf16bf3ae4d0" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1a6a7h7 alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>Can I skip or cancel?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="705dce98-fbe2-433c-b023-38cdcf189c12" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-54885v"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1on9z3k" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden=""><div data-rid="c65e4d06-5c16-48c7-b2cb-ce1c8d95de11" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-11pep3n"><div data-rid="4a51c39d-498c-4046-a7c8-7a4e33b3f333" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1hw6t90 alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>Yes. You can adjust your delivery schedule, plan type, frequency and even cancel completely through your online account portal. If you'd prefer, chat with us and we'll help customize your Membership to meet your exact preferences and schedule.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="180a6fb4-ad7b-4d09-9816-95ffe6f43e81" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0" class="r-nokhsg"><div data-rid="dec17269-3b60-48e0-9e44-1c578a374439" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" class="r-32yw61"><picture data-rid="32662ae5-6c60-4db5-bdcf-e7f34118c257" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1kxkpgs"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Mask_group_b8570538-e8d9-4f91-9eb4-696f05f521da.png?v=1706701347&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Mask_group_b8570538-e8d9-4f91-9eb4-696f05f521da.png?v=1706701347&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 820px)"/><sou